        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda kyava n'akoba nti: “Bwenebwene ndayira nti nga bwendi omulamu, ndimwesasulizaaku olw'okunhoomoola kye yeeyama ye ndi, n'amenha endagaano yange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndimutega naamugemya mu lutuula lwange, naamutwala mu Babilonia. Naamusalira eyo omusango gwamusinga, era naamubonereza olw'obutaba mwesigwa ye ndi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisirukale be abasinga kulwana baliitirwa mu lutalo, ate abalirumuka ni bawonagho baasansaanira mu ndhuyi dhoonadhoona. Olwo mulimanha nga nze Musengwa Katonda ninze ndhogeire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
